<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Wayne Highlands Sch Dist., Pa.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Wayne Highlands Sch Dist., Pa.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hopper Soliday &amp; Co., Inc. said it received the written award for the $11.575 million of Wayne Highlands School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series of 1997 with a top yield of 5.471 percent in 2014.</p>
</text>
